Echo-Wing kidnapped Panthar and is flying him up the elevator shaft in order to drop him down and smash through the gates to get to the bottom level. Meanwhile, Banana and Silver-Byte (Arachno-Ape?) are headed up the emergency stairs to get reinforcements. Panthar uses his newfound easy-to-use powers – including his power of friendship - to try and pull the corruption out of Echo-Wing… but the bat man keep trying to warn him that he might just be falling for a deadly trap…

